{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S07、S11、S12 等段落的感受词和比喻略显堆叠，水波、旧房子、发烧等意象切换较快，偶尔会抢过人物本身的情绪。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点词放大加亮，感受词降低视觉权重，又按音乐段落出现，观众可以先抓人物心理，再跟着音乐接收细节，不必一次读完所有文字。更重要的是，Y 保留了人物心理变化中的细小因果，例如从害怕自己要得太多，到意识到可能互相依靠，再到想让对方安心，这些让人物为什么欢喜、为什么害怕、为什么最终选择坦然喜欢都更清楚。X 的叙事更紧凑，但部分心理层次和音乐中的细微变化被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dc66b267-aaf4-43c9-ae5e-2908454f69ba", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054232125509Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:43:47.047264+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bc63d7e1048a9f25f80ba1e848f72e094ab258056c26b4e3b09ee44e469036af", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch